source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira renders an error icon inside a call expression in prose; jiro reads the icon as an emoticon directive and reports nothing.
